WEBVTT

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:01.462
they come together in this complex web.

00:17:01.486 --> 00:17:04.556
And they build a big, complex world.

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:06.959
And suddenly, without realizing it,

00:17:06.983 --> 00:17:09.160
you're seeing the world differently.

00:17:09.184 --> 00:17:10.947
Everything has changed.

00:17:10.971 --> 00:17:12.714
Everything in your life has changed.

00:17:13.821 --> 00:17:16.894
And that's, of course, what this is about.

00:17:16.918 --> 00:17:20.040
Attend to other lives,

00:17:20.064 --> 00:17:21.422
other visions.

00:17:21.446 --> 00:17:23.871
Listen to other people,

00:17:23.895 --> 00:17:25.740
enlighten ourselves.

00:17:26.509 --> 00:17:30.136
I'm not saying that I support
the terrorists in Iraq.